2026-07-27T15:26:37.5479090Z [36;1m# standard flags R selects per version (e.g. -std=gnu2x for C, -std=gnu++17[0m
2026-07-27T15:26:37.5479625Z [36;1m# / -std=gnu++20 for C++); a plain "CC = ccache gcc" override would drop[0m
2026-07-27T15:26:37.5480113Z [36;1m# them and silently downgrade the standard across the version matrix.[0m
2026-07-27T15:26:37.5480609Z [36;1m# Inference uses an empty user Makevars so we always read the pristine[0m
2026-07-27T15:26:37.5481052Z [36;1m# Makeconf defaults, never a value we just wrote.[0m
